  ('10', 10, false, 'W-2 payroll · B. Registrations', '**QBO Payroll set up 2026-09-25 (Claude, in the pane):** Workforce Payroll tier on the 30-day trial ($85/mo after); company + 501(c)(3) type (no FUTA); Form 941, monthly deposits; pay schedule Monthly (end of month), first payday 10-30; **Washington taxes entered** (ESD 1.29% + EAF 0.02%, WA Cares and Paid Leave employee-paid, L&I account, classes 6103-01 / 6104-01 effective 10-01); four of five employees with SOC codes, salaries, sick leave and workers'' comp class; accounting mapping (bank 8048, Teacher Salaries, Payroll Taxes - Employer, liabilities, class Tuition Program). **Bank connected 2026-09-25.** Paused: President needs from the teachers the Qur''an teacher''s legal name + email, the assistant''s email and pay basis. **Then (President):** Finish Up → Done on the team list, e-sign the tax authorization forms, decide the Pre-K assistant''s pay (below minimum wage as salaried), give the Qur''an teacher''s legal name + email and the assistant''s email. Workforce invites to the three teachers went out automatically', 'Muneeb (accountant); bank + e-sign by Muneeb (President)', '2026-10-03', '2026-10-03', 'Waiting', null, '[]'::jsonb, now()),
