  ('51', 51, false, 'Hub', '**accounts.md Owner/Recovery** — recorded 2026-09-26: Cloudflare, GitHub, Supabase under the secondary school Google account `falahacademykent@gmail.com`; EmailJS under the school Gmail. **Still needed:** recovery phone/email + 2-step method for BOTH school Google accounts; Brevo; GA4 (G-V6DNKDR9Z8 exists; which account owns it) + Search Console owner; Facebook page admins; WhatsApp admin; Bank of America online login; Red Comet / MESBA / iCode; OneDrive. **Then the first git commit of the hub** (on the President''s go) Priority lowered by the President 2026-09-26.', 'Muneeb (President) answers → Claude records', '2026-10-17', '2026-10-17', 'In progress', null, '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('66', 66, false, 'Marketing', '**Entrance signage:** only an 11x17 banner marks the school at Al Huda. Get Al Huda''s OK, then order a portable A-frame or yard sign (about 24x36 in: logo, "Falah Academy", "Mon–Thu 9:00–2:00") for school days; check Kent''s portable-sign rules. While talking to Al Huda: ask them to correct the "Islamic School (Dugsi) Mon–Thu 9:00–1:00" line on alhudaislamiccenter.com/islamic-school (dugsi is weekends) and add a link to falahacademywa.org (was #25). Also photograph the entrance with the banner for the Google cover photo (#24)', 'Muneeb (President), Al Huda admin (Someone else)', 'next school visit', null, 'Parked', null, '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('67', 67, false, 'Governance', '**File the 2027 WA SOS annual report** (CCFS, UBI 605 907 024; window opens 2026-12-02, expiration 2027-05-31; $20; Express filing works while status is Active). Save the report + receipt to `records/01_Corporate & Legal/03. Registrations & Certificates`', 'Muneeb (President)', '2027-04-30', '2027-04-30', 'Not started', null, '[{"name": "2026-09-25_WA-SOS_Annual-Report-2026_Filed_UBI-605907024.pdf", "path": "67/2026-09-25_WA-SOS_Annual-Report-2026_Filed_UBI-605907024.pdf", "size": 298079}, {"name": "2026-09-25_WA-SOS_Annual-Report-2026_Note.md", "path": "67/2026-09-25_WA-SOS_Annual-Report-2026_Note.md", "size": 1287}]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('69', 69, false, 'Website New Feature', '**Admissions: sibling fee plan + payment status — SHIPPED to prod 2026-09-28 (dev `5150fa3`).** Next to the "Sibling enrolled" badge the card shows a pill per sibling ("$300/mo · Sep paid ✓" / "Sep unpaid · 1 mo behind" / "starts …"); the dialog lists months paid of months owed this school year and the last payment date; the Monthly fee box defaults to **$200** with a "family rate" hint when a paying sibling is found (still editable). No SQL needed. Mark done once the President has seen it on a real applicant with an enrolled sibling.', 'Muneeb (Principal) verifies', '2026-11-30', '2026-11-30', 'Ready', null, '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('74', 74, false, 'Compliance', '**Pay the ESD $25 late-report fee for Q2 2026** (UI Tax Billing Statement dated 2026-09-12: Q2 report was late, filed 09-21; balance $25, interest from 10-01, delinquent tax rate if anything for periods through June 30 is still outstanding on 09-30). President pays in EAMS via SAW and confirms Q2 shows as received; Claude records the penalty in QBO and files the confirmation. Statement filed in `records/03_…ESD/03. ESD Notices & Letters`', 'Muneeb (President) pays; Muneeb (accountant) records', '2026-09-30', '2026-09-30', 'Not started', null, '[{"name": "2026-09-12_ESD_UI-Tax-Billing-Statement_Sept-2026_$25-late-report-fee-Q2-2026.pdf", "path": "74/2026-09-12_ESD_UI-Tax-Billing-Statement_Sept-2026_$25-late-report-fee-Q2-2026.pdf", "size": 753787}]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('75', 75, false, 'Compliance', '**L&I Account Statement dated 2026-09-10: $924.62 "due upon receipt" on the Industrial Insurance account (customer no. 939993).** Almost certainly ESTIMATED premiums + late-report penalties assessed while no quarterly reports were on file — the zero-hour reports were filed on 09-21, after this statement. **Do not pay blind:** President signs in to My L&I (SAW) and checks the current balance; if estimates remain, call the L&I account manager (number on the 2026 rate notice) to have them reversed against the filed zero-hour reports and ask for penalty waiver as a first-time filer; pay only what survives (via Pay a Balance Due), then Claude records it and files the confirmation', 'Muneeb (President)', '2026-09-30', '2026-09-30', 'Not started', null, '[{"name": "2026-09-10_LNI_Account-Statement_$924.62-due_Industrial-Insurance-511674-00.pdf", "path": "75/2026-09-10_LNI_Account-Statement_$924.62-due_Industrial-Insurance-511674-00.pdf", "size": 192458}, {"name": "L&I Workers Comp Rate Notice \u2013 2026.pdf", "path": "75/L&I Workers Comp Rate Notice \u2013 2026.pdf", "size": 704925}]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('70', 70, false, 'Records / Portal', '**Student 10005 — returned paper forms (2026-09-27).** Claude: 4 phone photos cleaned into 3 PDFs in her `01. Admission` folder (Point of Contact · Medical-Allergies 2 pp · Photo/Video/Media Consent; originals kept in an `Originals` subfolder; tool now in `scripts/clean-forms.py`); SQL prepared (`Downloads/falah_prod_forms_10005.sql`) for emergency contact, physician/medical, guardian phones, primary contact = mother, and a prominent MEDIA-CONSENT note. **Uploads DONE by Claude 2026-09-27** via the President''s signed-in portal session: all four Required Documents slots filled (Primary Contact + Emergency Contact ← Point of Contact PDF; Medical/Allergies; Photo/Video/Media Consent), each verified showing 9/27/2026 + View. Birth Certificate slot still empty (a JPEG exists in her records folder — upload on request). SQL run in prod by the President 2026-09-27 (emergency contact, physician, guardian phones, primary contact = mother, media-consent note). Birth certificate also uploaded by Claude 2026-09-27 (verified 9/27/2026 · View) — **all five Required Documents slots filled; complete.** ⚠ Her media consent is **NO** for everything except private parent communication, and no name publicly', 'Claude ✅ · Muneeb ✅', '2026-09-27', '2026-09-27', 'Done', null, '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('72', 72, false, 'Portal', '**Parent Profile + Student/Parents page changes (President''s request 2026-09-27) — IN DEV `ed58e99`, verify then Claude mirrors to prod.** New **Parent Profile** page (`/admin/parents/:id`): children with grade + "Primary contact" pill and *Make primary contact*; other parents; portal account status, last sign-in, link/unlink/suspend. **Parents grid**: shows both parents with F/M badges; account status now from whichever parent holds the login (fixes 10005 showing "no account"); row click opens the parent profile. **Student Profile**: guardian names link to the parent profile; F/M badge; "Primary contact" pill; **right-click** a parent → Make primary contact / Open parent profile. **Docs**: phase 14 adds *Immunization Certificate (CIS)* and *Choice Transfer Confirmation* document types. **Verified in dev by the President and SHIPPED to prod 2026-09-27 (`f1ae90a`, also carries the Admissions dialog/sibling detection + US formats).** Phase 14 run in prod by the President 2026-09-27 — **complete**; all seven document types live in production.', 'Claude ✅ · Muneeb ✅', '2026-09-27', '2026-09-27', 'Done', null, '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('71', 71, false, 'Portal', '**Media-consent flags — LIVE in prod 2026-09-28** (dev `5150fa3`, prod `f025d4a`; phase 17 run in prod by the President; feature verified by Claude — student 10005''s signed form entered, badge reads "No public photos"). Student Profile shows a 📷 badge in the header ("Photos OK: public" · "Limited photo consent" · "No public photos" · "No photos at all" · "not on file") and an editable **Photo, Video & Media Consent** panel. **Remaining:** enter the other 15 students'' answers from their signed consent forms (10005 and 10015 done 2026-09-28; Required Documents → Photo, Video & Media Consent Form); until entered a student shows "not on file", which counts as no permission. Superseded in part by #73: families without an entered form will be asked to fill it in the portal themselves.', 'Muneeb (Principal)', '2026-10-31', '2026-10-31', 'In progress', null, '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('73', 73, false, 'Portal', '**Digital admission forms (Allergy · Medical · Photo/Media Consent) — LIVE in prod 2026-09-28** (dev `d206b45`, prod `280260e`; phase 18 run in prod by the President). Claude entered the two paper-form families'' Allergy + Medical forms through the admin dialog 2026-09-28 (all three forms show Completed for 10005 and 10015). **Open:** (a) President **re-runs the amended `platform_schema_phase18.sql` in prod** — office saves now count as reviewed, which clears the false "Updated by parent — review" flags on those six forms; (b) Vault secret `brevo_api_key` in prod (and dev) for the instant e-mail; (c) dev still needs phases 17 + 18 run. Original scope: Decisions 2026-09-28: portal forms replace paper for new families (not on the public website); families without an entered form see a reminder banner on the portal home (no pop-up) plus a Forms tab in Family Information; parents may update answers any time — every admin gets an in-app alert, and an **immediate e-mail** when an allergy, condition or medication is added or consent is withdrawn; Allergy and Medical are separate forms; immunizations stay a scanned certificate. Admin: Student Profile "Health & Consent Forms" card with status, summary, "Updated by parent — review" flag and Mark reviewed; a completed digital form ticks the Required Documents row. Phase 18 = medical_info form columns + per-form signature + review flag, parent write on media_consent, audit triggers, `notify_admins()` + `email_now()` (Brevo via pg_net, key from Vault). **President:** (1) run `dev/supabase/platform_schema_phase18.sql` in the dev SQL editor; (2) for the instant e-mail run once in the dev SQL editor `select vault.create_secret(''<BREVO_API_KEY value>'', ''brevo_api_key'');` (3) test as admin and as a parent on the dev portal; then Claude mirrors to prod. Follow-up: re-enter 10005 and 10015 through the new admin forms.', 'Claude → Muneeb (Principal) tests', '2026-10-10', '2026-10-10', 'In progress', null, '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('68', 68, false, 'Google / SEO', 'Ask 5–10 families for Google reviews — **parked by the President until after the second school year (summer 2027)**. WhatsApp draft ready: `marketing/whatsapp/2026-09_google-review-request.md`; link comes from the profile''s "Ask for reviews" button', 'Muneeb (President)', '2027-07-01', '2027-07-01', 'Parked', null, '[{"name": "2026-09_google-review-request.md", "path": "68/2026-09_google-review-request.md", "size": 1238}]'::jsonb, now()),
